.TH NN-INSPECT 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-inspect \- summarize a neural-network model artifact
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn inspect
[\fIoptions\fR]
.I model
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print format, hashes, graph counts, inputs, outputs, and optional sections for a model file or directory.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Machine-readable JSON with schema_version 1.
.TP
.B \-\-summary
Short summary only.
.TP
.B \-\-all
Include every section.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success; 3 file error; 4 malformed; 5 unsupported format.
.SH SEE ALSO
nn(1), nn-diff(1), nn-memory(1)
